abstract: >-
  A dependency-free Rust reader for DATASUS DBC/DBF files (PKWare DCL
  decompression and dBase parsing), with Apache Arrow record batches
  (datasus-arrow), a command-line converter to Parquet, CSV and DBF
  (datasus-cli) and Python bindings (datasuspy).
